filenumber 632777
! CONSISTENT nonuniform perm + enhancement.
! The initial map's near-well 150 m disc IS kpmax (1e-10) and its background
! IS kpmin (4e-13), so the near-well region starts already at the enhanced
! ceiling and slip propagates that conduit outward from the floor.
!
! This is the property that separates the archive: of 35 runs where
! kpmax = k_near AND kpmin = k_far, 29 reached dc and 12 land within 15% of
! the observed front. Of 77 runs whose bounds did not match their map, 2
! reached dc and none matched. The earlier conclusion that enhancement
! suppresses slip was drawn from that misconfigured 77.
!
! Contrast is 50x (kpmax 2e-11) or 250x (1e-10), reproducing the contrasts of
! the runs that matched the front (5e-14/1e-15 and 2.5e-13/1e-15) but with a
! PHYSICAL far field of 4e-13 rather than 1e-15 -- the 1e-15 is what let
! wellhead pressure run to +280% in that family.
!
! Understressed: muinit 0.46, sigmainit 27.99 -> tau0 12.88 MPa vs Taiyi 15.0.
! kL 1e-3, the value every front-matching run used.
! phi 0.02 x beta 2e-8 = phi*beta 4e-10. Storage is swept to its physical
! ceiling (4e-10) because a realistic far field raises diffusivity ~200x.
! STORAGE AT THE PHYSICAL FLOOR, enhancement OFF.
! Storage is the only lever that raises lambda without suppressing initiation:
! phi*beta 3e-11 -> lambda 0.0236, 2e-11 -> 0.0492 at muinit 0.46.
! Enhancement is ruled out -- 632701/703/707/709/711 all produced NO slip even
! with a +5.8 MPa margin, because at kL 1e-5 it bleeds pf below dp_crit.
! phi 0.02 x beta 2e-8 = 5.0e-12. beta 2e-8 is already the stiff edge of
! defensible (water alone is 4.4e-10 /Pa); phi 0.02 halves the product again.
! sigmainit 27.99, muinit 0.46 -> tau0 12.88 MPa (Taiyi 15.0), dp_crit 6.53.
! If lambda still falls short here, the front cannot be matched in this
! configuration at ANY physically admissible storage.

problem 3dp
imax 601
jmax 601
ds 0.020

interval 30
nstep 400000
tmax 0.02191781
dtmax 43200
dtout 0.0002
parameterfromfile T
parameter_file "perm_cons_601_ds20_kmax1e-10.txt"
parameter_file_ncol 1
backslip T
vpl 0d0
a 0.015
b 0.012
dc 1e-4
f0 0.6
muinit 0.46
sigmainit 27.99
velinit 1d-12
limitsigma T
minsig 1
velmin 1d-20

pressurediffusion T
permev T

kp 4e-13
kpmin 4e-13
kpmax 1e-10
phi 0.02
beta 2e-8
eta 0.89e-3

kL 1e-3
kT 1e15

pfinit 0d0
bcl Dirichlet
bcr Dirichlet
bct Dirichlet
bcb Dirichlet
pbcl 0d0
pbcr 0d0
pbct 0d0
pbcb 0d0

injectionfromfile T

injection_file "june_clean.txt"


rigid 24
Sw_fwid 7.4e-9
rw 8.9e-2
